irements; scoped sufficient evidence may resolve\na missing-evidence issue without having read every memory.\n\nWhen source_span_columns is present, source_spans contains row arrays. Match each\nrow position to source_span_columns to reconstruct every span object before\nreading. References to source_spans[].id or other fields mean those objects.\nThe id column holds source aliases (sN); doc_id holds the original document ID or,\nwhen source_documents is present, its metadata reference (dN), never source_ids.\n\n\nCURRENT PHASE: HISTORY EVIDENCE. Complete only the supplied historical task and\nrequested variable scopes. This is not the final response-selection stage.\nFor retrieval, extract concrete statements supported by the supplied original\nhistory. For an intermediate compose task, summarize those historical facts,\npreferences, constraints and changes using the supplied parent versions and\noriginal quotations. A history summary describes what the sources establish;\nit must not address the user, offer a new recommendation or draft a reply.\nThe original user utterance provides query context. It is not an instruction to\nanswer it at this stage or to retrieve an exact duplicate of what it already says.\nPublic response options are not available here. Do not invent, compare or refer\nto options A/B/C/D. Return exactly the slots object; no final_prediction or\nsemantic_answer fields belong in a history-evidence response.\nKeep each value within its declared type, entity and time scope. Preserve earlier\nand later attitudes, conditions and supporting quotations; a historical dislike\nmust not silently replace a later documented change. Assistant advice alone does\nnot establish an adopted user preference. Do not invent external catalogues,\navailability or past execution of a future suggestion. A partial observation must\ncite its actual clue. Use unresolved only for a specific condition still necessary\nto establish this requested historical value, not hypothetical exhaustive coverage.\nRe-read any supplied evidence obligations and their original sources explicitly;\ndo not drop a source or contradiction merely because a prior value is available.\n\nThis request is phase=history_evidence. Its ONLY top-level output field is slots. Do not return semantic_answer, final_prediction, audit_verdict, or any other top-level field, even null. Read or summarize the requested scoped historical evidence; do not write a conversational reply or invent candidate responses.\n\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"slots\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"oneOf\":[{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"allOf\":[{\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"const\":\"user\"},\"time_scope\":{\"const\":\"past\"}}}}],\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"type\":\"null\"}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"support\"}}},\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"fact_82f4c5e272a53e19fd2a49b6\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}}}}},\"resolved_obligation_ids\":{\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"obligation_bda4a83170f20e2367bd49c1\"]}},\"variable\":{\"const\":\"past_interests\"}}}],\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"allOf\":[{\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"maxItems\":0}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"contradiction\"}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"minItems\":1}}}}],\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"parent_versions\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"source_ids\":{\"description\":\"Exact visible source_spans[].id aliases, such as s3; never document IDs or invented IDs.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"time_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"stance\",\"value\",\"source_ids\",\"entity_scope\",\"time_scope\",\"parent_versions\",\"retract_ids\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"resolved_obligation_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"variable\":{\"enum\":[\"past_interests\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"variable\",\"observations\",\"unresolved\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":1,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"slots\"],\"type\":\"object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I'm exploring new creative outlets and would love some suggestions. Any ideas on activities that can capture emotions and ideas effectively?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What creative activities has the user previously expressed interest in or tried?\",\"output_slot\":\"past_interests\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What creative activities has the user previously expressed interest in or tried?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"852ab8164b42de91586c64ca83f468b8b7a83c646e426198b8978ca06e57f279\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"a14c9661ddc1f95730ac4e352bc0971df48c22d0038bde0a598989983344b418\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"830de1e05945c07fd823bec5ca86477e93146b276d7cd2ded062fd2ca155ca25\"},\"variables\":{\"past_interests\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"past_interests\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"past_interests\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"past_interests\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"present\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_82f4c5e272a53e19fd2a49b6\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has expressed interest in and tried creating digital music remixes, composing original music, audio production, podcasting about music fusion, field recording blending nature sounds with music, and writing blog posts reflecting on personal experiences.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s64\",\"s43\",\"s106\",\"s95\",\"s15\",\"s63\",\"s27\",\"s98\",\"s70\",\"s96\",\"s25\",\"s108\",\"s16\",\"s26\",\"s97\",\"s107\",\"s24\",\"s44\",\"s14\",\"s71\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"Multiple user statements across conversations establish these creative activities. The user described creating digital music remixes (s70, s71, s43, s44), composing original tracks (s14, s15, s16), launching a podcast about music fusion (s24, s25, s26, s27), field recording blending nature sounds with music (s106, s107, s108), writing blog posts reflecting on personal experiences (s63, s64), and enrolling in an audio production workshop (s95, s96, s97, s98).\",\"variable\":\"past_interests\",\"revoked\":[{\"source_ids\":[\"s126\",\"s127\",\"s128\"],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly stated they dropped out of the audio production course after the first week (s126, s127, s128). This contradicts the earlier support observation's claim of sustained interest in audio production, as the user did not complete the course. The retraction targets the entire support observation because the user's later statement shows the audio production workshop enrollment did not lead to continued engagement.\"}],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s12\",\"d1\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s13\",\"d1\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s14\",\"d1\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s15\",\"d1\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s16\",\"d1\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s24\",\"d2\",105,447,\"User: Yes! I launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music. This platform has allowed me to reach a wider audience and share my experiences authentically. By interviewing artists and enthusiasts, I can dive deep into their creative processes and discover how they incorporate various elements into their music. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s25\",\"d2\",447,817,\"The feedback I’ve received has been overwhelmingly positive, with listeners appreciating the insights and stories shared. I also love being able to explore not just the music itself, but the cultural contexts that shape these genres and influence artists worldwide.\\n\\nUser: I realized that sharing my experiences could inspire others and even reignite my own creativity. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s26\",\"d2\",817,1128,\"The process of putting my thoughts into words has helped clarify my own perspective. It’s surprising how reflecting on past experiences can lead to deeper insights about one’s journey. Additionally, I’ve noticed that when I articulate my thoughts, it motivates me to think critically about my creative process. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s27\",\"d2\",1128,1266,\"This paradigm shift has not only invigorated my passion for music but also allowed me to connect with others who share similar sentiments.\",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s43\",\"d3\",103,370,\"User: That was back in 2010. I remember feeling really excited about the whole process. It was such a wave of creativity! I still think about those late nights spent tweaking sounds and layering beats, capturing the essence of what I wanted to express through music. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s44\",\"d3\",370,611,\"The thrill of sharing those creations with others is something I cherish deeply, as it fostered a sense of community among my friends. Looking back, it feels like a pivotal moment that sparked my passion for music production and digital art.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s51\",\"d4\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s52\",\"d4\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s63\",\"d5\",107,454,\"User: I wrote a new blog post reflecting on these experiences. In this post, I aimed to unpack the various feelings that emerged during my recent dating adventures, such as joy, confusion, and even frustration at times. It’s fascinating how writing helps to clarify my thoughts, transforming chaotic emotions into coherent narratives on the page. \",\"user\",[118]],[\"s64\",\"d5\",454,767,\"I often find that the simple act of putting pen to paper—or fingers to keyboard—allows me to examine events from multiple angles. My reflections serve not only as a way to process what has happened in my personal life but also as an opportunity to connect with others who might be experiencing similar situations.\",\"user\",[118]],[\"s70\",\"d6\",103,431,\"User: Hi there! I've recently been diving deeper into my passion for music and technology. It's been quite a journey since I started creating digital music remixes. Every aspect of this process has been fascinating, from selecting the right software to getting the nuances of mixing different sounds to create something unique. \",\"user\",[1]],[\"s71\",\"d6\",431,678,\"I often find myself lost in the intricacies of audio layers, where a subtle change can completely transform a track. Additionally, the way technology evolves continues to inspire me, as new tools emerge that enhance both creativity and efficiency.\",\"user\",[1]],[\"s78\",\"d7\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s79\",\"d7\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s95\",\"d8\",105,388,\"User: Absolutely! After attending a hands-on workshop focused on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, I’m now enrolled in an audio production workshop. The workshop was eye-opening, providing insights into how to use technology to enhance traditional music forms. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s96\",\"d8\",388,780,\"I’m excited about the audio production course because it promises to deepen my technical knowledge and skills, especially in mixing and mastering. This new set of skills will allow me to bring my creative vision to life in ways I never thought possible. I truly believe that this journey will not only elevate my music but also connect me more deeply with the traditions I'm learning about.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s97\",\"d8\",780,1127,\"User: I found the practical aspects very exciting and relevant to my projects. Engaging in hands-on activities allows me to not only enhance my skills but also gain the confidence to experiment with different methods. It's invigorating to immerse myself in a learning environment where I can translate my imaginative ideas into tangible outcomes. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s98\",\"d8\",1127,1386,\"This experience feels entirely different from the theoretical coursework, as it truly brings the subject to life. I believe this grounding in practical techniques will significantly impact my overall creative journey and foster a deeper connection to my work.\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s106\",\"d9\",105,344,\"User: It was a great way to blend my love for the outdoors with my musical creativity. The sounds of nature really added depth to the track, creating a rich tapestry of auditory experiences that transported listeners to serene landscapes. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s107\",\"d9\",344,695,\"Moments spent in the woods, by riversides, or during rainy afternoons provided the perfect backdrop for inspiration, as I captured the essence of what it feels like to be in those environments. Each recording not only served as an instrument but also as a reminder of the memories tied to those places, enriching the emotional resonance of the music. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s108\",\"d9\",695,817,\"This blending of natural elements with melody has truly rejuvenated my passion for creating and sharing music with others.\",\"user\",[81]],[\"s126\",\"d10\",107,396,\"User: However, I dropped out of the audio production course after the first week, feeling overwhelmed by the complexity of the material. It was a tough decision because I really wanted to dive deeper into that realm of knowledge but the sheer volume of information presented was daunting. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s127\",\"d10\",396,649,\"I keep reflecting on whether I could have approached it differently or managed my time better throughout those early days in the course. There’s a part of me that fears missing out on valuable skills that are essential for pursuing my passion in music. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s128\",\"d10\",649,816,\"I’ve been thinking about other ways to learn audio production that might feel less intense and more manageable, perhaps through self-study or online resources instead.\",\"user\",[105]],[\"s196\",\"d11\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 168–169 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s197\",\"d11\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s198\",\"d11\",107,504,\"User: I found that my reviews were often criticized for not being objective, which made me less engaged in the process. It felt like I was constantly under the microscope, where every word I wrote was scrutinized by people who often missed the nuance of my opinion. This external pressure led me to second-guess not only my thoughts but also my emotional connection to the music I was discussing. \",\"user\",[168]],[\"s199\",\"d11\",504,830,\"In the end, I realized that the joy I once found in sharing my perspective on albums was overshadowed by the fear of backlash, and that’s a heavy burden for anyone. It became clearer to me that my passion for music needed to be expressed in a more personal, less public way, which is something I’m finally starting to embrace.\",\"user\",[168]],[\"s200\",\"d11\",830,843,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s201\",\"d11\",843,1092,\"Assistant: That’s understandable. Focusing on your artistic expression is more important than fitting into external expectations. Art and music should ultimately be about how they resonate with you and the experiences you wish to share with others. \",\"assistant\",[169]],[\"s202\",\"d11\",1092,1312,\"It’s fascinating how different forms of expression can sometimes become shackled by the very audience they aim to reach, leading to a disconnect that stifles creativity. What about music theory? Have you revisited that? \",\"assistant\",[169]],[\"s203\",\"d11\",1312,1578,\"Diving into the intricacies of music theory can be a great way to reconnect with your love for music without the external pressures, allowing you to explore harmonies, rhythms, and even the cultural context that often informs those Pacific Island texts and rhythms. \",\"assistant\",[169]],[\"s204\",\"d11\",1578,1731,\"It can serve as a method of grounding your creativity, giving you new tools to articulate your feelings and thoughts about music in a more enriching way.\",\"assistant\",[169]]],\"evidence_obligations\":[{\"id\":\"obligation_bda4a83170f20e2367bd49c1\",\"variable\":\"past_interests\",\"entit